-06 01:15 UTC</span></div><div class=3D"comment__body"><p>There is a script=
ed "success" that usually takes place in early to mid Y4 (I've had it happe=
n in late Y3, but rarely). This scripted success will almost always score a=
 9+, and get you over the $1M mark. If you can last to Y4, you should be go=
od, because as long as you don't leave the garage (until around $3M in the =
